# Only public build inputs enter the context. Local state, .env, Git history,
# diagnostics, tests and tooling are deliberately not sent to the builder.
**
!Dockerfile
!entrypoint.sh
!healthcheck.sh
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!licenses/
!licenses/**
!config/
!config/**
!assets/
!assets/**

# Defense in depth if a private file is accidentally placed in an allowed tree.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/registration.json
**/reg.json
**/settings.json
**/mdm.xml
**/warp_state
**/cloudflare-warp
**/*.log
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.zip
